// Hero classes and skill books. Design intent: docs/CLASS_SKILL_DESIGN.md.
// Each class: one basic attack, and per slot (mobility Q / area E / finisher R) skills `a` and `b`.
// Levels 1-6 unlock exactly one skill each: finisher a, mobility a, area a, finisher b, mobility b, area b.
(
    classes: [
        (
            class: warden,
